Mike makes cogent points, as always. I will also point out that one's intuition on what pattern to expect is sometimes a bit off, when viewing trends conditioned on a phylogeny. It is quite a challenge to mentally conjure up an ordination, or PLS projection, in one's head while accounting for the phylogeny.

Dean

